ejs","html_url":"https://github.com/vikejs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vikejs/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/vikejs/vike","description":"(Replaces Next.js/Nuxt) 🔨 Composable framework to build advanced applications with flexibility and stability.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/deployments","created_at":"2021-01-28T10:27:12Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T05:17:23Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-09T02:46:08Z","git_url":"git://github.com/vikejs/vike.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:vikejs/vike.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/vikejs/vike.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/vikejs/vike","homepage":"https://vike.dev","size":44770,"stargazers_count":5633,"watchers_count":5633,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":383,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":76,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["full-stack","node","react","react-ssr","server-rendering","server-side-rendering","solid","solid-ssr","ssr","static-site-generator","vite","vite-plugin","vite-ssr","vitejs","vue","vue-ssr","web-framework"],"visibility":"public","forks":383,"open_issues":76,"watchers":5633,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I wrote a little component that includes third party packages that cannot be rendered server side (`midi-player-js` and `soundfont-player`; they are using AudioContext and XMLHttpRequest). Following the [docs](https://vite-plugin-ssr.com/dynamic-import) the best way to solve this problem would be to use dynamic imports. So shouldn't it be enough to just use `defineAsyncComponent` because [Vue](https://vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html) wraps the component into a Promise?\r\n\r\n```vue\r\n<script setup>\r\n// pages/song.page.vue\r\nconst MidiPlayer = defineAsyncComponent(() => import('../../components/MidiPlayer.vue'));\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<template>\r\n    <MidiPlayer />\r\n</template>\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut if I use it like this the server still tries to render the component and throws `XMLHttpRequest is not defined` when running `npm run dev`. With a condition on the component to only render it in browser it still failes with `AudioContext is not defined` since the component gets loaded in SSR even if it's not displayed in the template.\r\n\r\n```vue\r\n<script setup>\r\n// pages/song.page.vue\r\nconst isBrowser = typeof window !== 'undefined';\r\nconst MidiPlayer = defineAsyncComponent(() => import('../../components/MidiPlayer.vue'));\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<template>\r\n    <MidiPlayer v-if=\"isBrowser\" />\r\n</template>\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo I wrote a litte `<ClientOnly>` component:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// components/ClientOnly.js\r\nimport { h } from 'vue';\r\n\r\nconst isBrowser = typeof window !== 'undefined';\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n    setup(props, { slots }) {\r\n        const slot = slots.default ? slots.default() : [];\r\n        return () => (isBrowser ? h('div', {}, [slot]) : h('div'));\r\n    },\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis seems to work better but I get an error: `Hydration completed but contains mismatches.` Is there a way to prevent this from happening?\r\n\r\nAt the end the best way to do this for me was to add an additional component `AsyncMidiPlayer`:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// components/AsyncMidiPlayer.js\r\nimport { defineAsyncComponent, h } from 'vue';\r\n\r\nconst isBrowser = typeof window !== 'undefined';\r\n\r\nconst MidiPlayer = defineAsyncComponent(() => import('./MidiPlayer.vue'));\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n    setup(props, context) {\r\n        return () => isBrowser ? h(MidiPlayer, {...props,...context.attrs,}): h('div');\r\n    },\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd to use it like this:\r\n\r\n```vue\r\n<script setup>\r\n// pages/song.page.vue\r\nimport AsyncMidiPlayer from '../components/AsyncMidiPlayer.js';\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<template>\r\n    <AsyncMidiPlayer  />\r\n</template>\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut since I have multiple components that cannot be interpreted server side I would like to have a better solution than writing a custom wrapper for each of them. I was not able to create a generic version of this because the import source needs to be specific (I ran into `The above dynamic import cannot be analyzed by vite.`). I'm sure there is a better solution for this. Did anyone find a better solution to this than me? It would be nice to extend the vite-plugin-ssr docs with a working vue 3 example.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/issues/278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vikejs/vike/issues/278/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":10814288661,"node_id":"LOE_lADOCCum184syDXezwAAAAKElPMV","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/10814288661","actor":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"locked","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-10-31T00:18:55Z","lock_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null}]